e third King, His Majesty Jigme Dorji Wangchuck. \\\"Yangchenphug\\\" is a combination of two words: \\\"Yangchen\\\" is short for \\\"Lhamo Yangchenma,\\\" the goddess of wisdom and music in Tibetan Buddhism, and \\\"phug\\\" in this context means \\\"hill.\\\" The school's annual magazine is named \\\"Yangchen Juedmang]], representing the lute, the musical instrument associated with the goddess. Colloquially, the school has come to be known as \\\"Y-Chess.\\\" Yangchenphug Higher Secondary School has historically been\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0071-bbd7a3627ba7:d01\", \"text\": \"Yangchenphug Higher Secondary School (Dzongkha: དབྱངས་ཅན་ཕུག་འབྲིང་རིམ་སློབ་གྲྭ་གོང་མ) is a co-ed public high school in Kathmandu, Nepal. It was founded in 1965 by the third King, His Majesty Jigme Dorji Wangchuck. \\\"Yangchenphug\\\" is a combination of two words: \\\"Yangchen\\\" is short for \\\"Lhamo Yangchenma,\\\" the goddess of wisdom and music in Tibetan Buddhism, and \\\"phug\\\" in this context means \\\"hill.\\\" The school's annual magazine is named \\\"Yangchen Juedmang]], representing the lute, the musical instrument associated with the goddess. Colloquially, the school has come to be known as \\\"Y-Chess.\\\" Yangchenphug Higher Secondary School has historically been a significant educational institution in Kathmandu, contributing to the academic and cultural landscape of the city.\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0071-bbd7a3627ba7:d02\", \"text\": \"Error Facebook Facebook is not available on this browser To continue using Facebook , get one of the browsers below . Learn more English ( US ) + Meta © 2025\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0071-bbd7a3627ba7:d03\", \"text\": \"Class XII Board Specimen 2013 : Computer Science Paper 1 ( Theory ) by isc 1 ISC Class XII Board Specimen 2011 : Accounts by isc 1 CBSE Class X 2013 : ENGLISH LANGUAGE & LITERATURE by cbse10 1 GATE 2015 : Architecture and Planning by gate 1 ISC Board Exam 2014 : Physics Paper 1 ( Theory ) with Model Answers by isc